<div id="game-wrapper">
  <div class="score-row">
    {{ statCard("Score", "score-display", "0") }} {{ statCard("Level", "level-display", "1") }} {{ statCard("Best",
    "best-display", "0") }} {{ statCard("Lives", "lives-display", "❤️❤️❤️") }}
  </div>

  <div id="now-playing">🎹 <strong id="song-name">—</strong></div>

  <div class="canvas-wrapper">
    <canvas id="canvas"></canvas>

    <div id="overlay">
      <span>🎹</span>
      <h2>Piano Tiles</h2>

      <div id="step-diff">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem">Choose difficulty:</p>
        <div class="diff-row">
          <button class="diff-btn" id="btn-easy" onclick="showSongStep('easy')">🎵 Easy</button>
          <button class="diff-btn" id="btn-medium" onclick="showSongStep('medium')">🎶 Medium</button>
          <button class="diff-btn" id="btn-hard" onclick="showSongStep('hard')">🎸 Hard</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="step-songs" style="display: none">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.4rem">
          Pick a song — <strong id="step-diff-label" style="color: #a78bfa"></strong>:
        </p>
        <div id="song-list"></div>
        <button class="diff-btn" style="margin-top: 0.3rem" onclick="showDiffStep()">← Back</button>
      </div>

      <div id="step-play" style="display: none">
        <div id="song-card">
          <div id="card-song"></div>
          <div id="card-artist"></div>
          <div id="card-fact"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem">
          <p>Tap each tile in time with the music!</p>
          <button class="play-btn" onclick="startGame()">Play Game</button>
          <button class="diff-btn" onclick="showSongStep(currentDifficulty)">← Back</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="gameover-overlay">
      <span id="go-icon">💀</span>
      <h2 id="go-title">Game Over</h2>
      <div class="summary-row">
        {{ summaryStatCard("Score", "go-score") }} {{ summaryStatCard("Best", "go-best") }} {{ summaryStatCard("Level",
        "go-level", "1") }}
      </div>
      <button class="play-btn" onclick="startGame()">Play Again</button>
      <button class="diff-btn" onclick="showOverlay()">Change Song</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="info-section">
    {% call infoDetails("How to Play") %}
    <div class="info-body">
      <h4>Goal</h4>
      <p>
        Tap colored tiles as they fall in time with the music. You have <strong>3 lives</strong> — each tile that slips
        past the bottom costs one life. Game over when all lives are gone.
      </p>
      <h4>Controls</h4>
      <p>
        Click or tap on the colored tiles as they scroll down the screen. Tapping empty space does nothing — only tiles
        count!
      </p>
      <h4>Difficulty &amp; Songs</h4>
      <p>
        Easy songs fall slowly (~65–74 BPM). Medium falls at a moderate pace (~96–112 BPM). Hard songs fall fast
        (140–160 BPM). Each difficulty has 5 songs — pick one or let the demo play.
      </p>
      <h4>Lives</h4>
      <p>
        You start with 3 ❤️ lives. A tile passing the bottom without being tapped removes one life. Tapping empty space
        is forgiving — no penalty!
      </p>
      <h4>Scoring &amp; Levels</h4>
      <p>
        Each tapped tile scores 10 points. Speed increases every 10 tiles. Best score is saved separately per
        difficulty.
      </p>
    </div>
    {% endcall %} {% call infoDetails("Song List") %}
    <div class="info-body">
      <h4>🎵 Easy</h4>
      <p>
        Twinkle Twinkle Little Star · Mary Had a Little Lamb · Someone Like You (Adele) · Ode to My Family (The
        Cranberries) · Let It Be (The Beatles)
      </p>
      <h4>🎶 Medium</h4>
      <p>
        Ode to Joy (Beethoven) · Jingle Bells · It's My Life (Bon Jovi) · Zombie (The Cranberries) · Rolling in the Deep
        (Adele)
      </p>
      <h4>🎸 Hard</h4>
      <p>
        Für Elise (Beethoven) · Canon in D (Pachelbel) · Don't Stop Me Now (Queen) · APT. (Rosé &amp; Bruno Mars) ·
        Shake It Off (Taylor Swift)
      </p>
    </div>
    {% endcall %} {% call infoDetails("FAQ") %}
    <div class="info-body">
      <h4>What happens when I tap empty space?</h4>
      <p>
        Nothing — tapping empty space is harmless. Only tiles that pass the bottom without being tapped cost a life.
      </p>
      <h4>Is my best score saved?</h4>
      <p>Yes — best scores are saved per difficulty (Easy / Medium / Hard) in browser local storage.</p>
      <h4>Can I pick a specific song?</h4>
      <p>
        Yes! The welcome screen lets you choose difficulty first, then pick any song from that difficulty's pool.
        There's also a Random option.
      </p>
    </div>
    {% endcall %}
  </div>
</div>

